starting Phase A (copy + constants + re-hydrate `src/app`)?"},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"proceed"}]},{"role":"assistant","content":"Starting Phase A. First: repo copy feasibility + artifact identities.","reasoning_content":"Proceed with Phase A. Steps:\n1. Create ~/Projects/active/grok-bot-0.44-reconstructed/ from reference copy, strip .git? Reference has git? Check. Copy excluding research-archives LFS binaries maybe (large). Check size first.\n2. Compute DMG sha256 + asar sha256.\n3. Update config.mjs constants.\n4. Re-hydrate src/app from analysis/extracted.\n5. PROVENANCE rewrite.\n\nAlso verify 0.44 Electron version from DMG (need to mount or check cached app). Let me start: check reference repo size and whether it has .git.","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_f686213032cbea972881e34c68308fb4","type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"cd \\\"/Users/panda/Projects/test-local/grok-bot/refrence/grok-bot-0.18-reconstructed-main\\\"; du -sh . ; du -sh research-archives .git 2>/dev/null; ls -d .git 2>/dev/null || echo \\\"no .git\\\"; echo ---; shasum -a 256 \\\"/Users/panda/Projects/test-local/grok-bot/Grok_Bot_0.44.0.dmg\\\" &\\nwait\",\"timeout\":120}"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":" 32M\t.\n 20K\tresearch-archives\nno .git\n---\n020d6080b44a11c91cefe6ff11d0e30f993efa54991f8c1a4625653499c21420  /Users/panda/Projects/test-local/grok-bot/Grok_Bot_0.44.0.dmg\n","tool_call_id":"call_f686213032cbea972881e34c68308fb4"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"reasoning_content":"DMG sha256: 020d6080b44a11c91cefe6ff11d0e30f993efa54991f8c1a4625653499c21420. Reference is 32M total, no .git, no LFS binaries (research-archives 20K — just manifests). Easy copy.\n\nNext: original asar sha256. The DMG contains app.asar. analysis/extracted was extracted from the asar. Need the asar file itself — maybe in analysis/app.asar (141MB dir listing showed analysis/ has app.asar? Actually the dir listing earlier showed analysis/ with entries: app.asar